---
import Card from "@/components/Card.astro";
---

<section id="journey" class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <p class="type-label text-suzaku-green/80 mb-4">Get started</p>
    <h2 class="type-heading mb-4">
      Three steps to a<br />decentralized L1.
    </h2>
    <p class="type-subheading text-white/40 mb-16 max-w-2xl">
      You don't need to go fully permissionless from day one. Every step
      forward reduces your exposure. We guide you through each one.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <Card padding="lg" class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="type-label text-suzaku-green/80 mb-4">01</div>
        <div class="type-card-title text-white mb-3">Audit your L1</div>
        <p class="type-body text-white/50 mb-8 flex-1">
          Start with our free L1 Auditor. See your Nakamoto coefficient, your
          decentralization stage, and exactly where your chain is exposed.
          Takes seconds. No signup.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://auditor.suzaku.network"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="type-btn-sm text-suzaku-black bg-suzaku-gradient px-5 py-2 rounded hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity self-start"
        >
          Audit your L1 ↗
        </a>
      </Card>

      <Card padding="lg" class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="type-label text-suzaku-green/80 mb-4">02</div>
        <div class="type-card-title text-white mb-3">Plan your roadmap</div>
        <p class="type-body text-white/50 mb-8 flex-1">
          Get in touch with our team. We'll design a decentralization
          plan tailored to your chain, your timeline, and your community. No
          commitment required.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://forms.gle/US695J3BYoy8tztu9"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="type-btn-sm text-white border border-white/10 px-5 py-2 rounded hover:border-suzaku-green transition-colors self-start"
        >
          Get in touch ↗
        </a>
      </Card>

      <Card padding="lg" class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="type-label text-suzaku-green/80 mb-4">03</div>
        <div class="type-card-title text-white mb-3">Build and implement</div>
        <p class="type-body text-white/50 flex-1">
          Leverage our protocol and operator network. Progressive
          PoS, liquid staking for your community, and hands-on support from
          start to finish.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
